  "body": "### Summary\nThe floating « + » button replies like the forum by default. A member who chose another value keeps it.\n\n### Decision (operator, 2026-11-17, point H)\n« Comportement bouton \"+\" => par défaut répondre comme sur le forum, unless changed. »\n\n### Today\n- `ReaderSettings.swift:18` defaults to `.quick`, as legacy does (`AppReplyButtonBehavior`, default `quick`, `Common.swift:243-262` @ `21173e77`; #654). The setting is in Réglages › Sujets › « Bouton + » (`SettingsView.swift:165`).\n\n### Scope\n- The default becomes `.forum` (« Répondre comme le forum »).\n- **Unless changed**: a stored value is kept as is. Only an absent key takes the new default. Check how the settings store tells « never set » from « set to quick ». If a migrated legacy value always exists, say so in the PR.\n- This deliberately differs from legacy: add a `changelog` or `gap-edit` entry in the PR's `### Ledger`.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Fresh install: « Répondre comme le forum ».\n- [ ] A stored `quick` or `hidden` stays.\n- [ ] Tests for both cases, each failing without the change.\n\n### Related\n#654, #552.",
