   "body": "/claim cloud/i1016-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- Default of `SettingKey.replyButtonBehavior` (HFRStorage) and of the two reader fallbacks (`ReaderSettings.replyButton`, `ReaderSettingsWatch.replyButton`) becomes `.forum`.\n- Only an absent key takes it: `UserDefaultsSettingsStore.rawValue` returns nil for a never-set key, so a stored `quick`/`hidden` is read as is. `LegacySettingsNormalizer` does not touch this key and nothing writes it at launch.\n- Tests (Swift Testing): absent → `.forum`; stored `quick` / `hidden` kept; fail without the change. Update the existing tests that assumed `.quick`.\n- Docs: `LOT-086`/`LOT-119` specs mention the default; update. Ledger entry (`changelog` + `gap-edit`/`gap-new`) in the PR body only.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, adversarial review (Opus), no ready mark, no merge.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
